<h1>Split Mesh</h1>
<hr align="left" width="100.526%" size="5" class="whs3">
<p><span lang="EN-GB">This command is accessible from</span> <i style="font-style:normal; font-weight:bold;"><span class="Path" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Mesh &gt; Split Mesh</b></span></i><span lang="EN-GB">.</span></p>
<p class="description"><span class="Command" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Description:</b></span> <span class="Command">The</span> <span class="Command">Split Mesh</span> <span lang="EN-GB">command divides the whole mesh entity to sub-meshes and creates N new mesh items in the entity tree. This command is grayed if there is no selection or all selections are hidden. It works on wholly selected entities as well as on partial selections.</span></p>
<p class="Example" style="text-decoration:underline;"><span lang="EN-GB"><a class="dropspot" href="javascript:kadovTextPopup(this)" id="a1" style="text-decoration:underline;">Example</a></span></p>
<div class="droptext" id="POPUP223387004" style="display:'none'; x-ss-type:dropdown;">
<table cellspacing="5" class="whs4">
<col>
<col>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td class="whs6">
<p><img src="../images/whole_mesh.gif" width="375px" height="223px" border="0" class="img_whs7" alt=""></p>
</td>
<td class="whs8">
<p><img src="../images/divided_mesh.gif" width="114px" height="223px" border="0" class="img_whs9" alt=""></p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td rowspan="1" colspan="2" class="whs10">
<p>Whole mesh (on left) and divided to 49 sub-meshes (on right)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" class="whs5">
<td rowspan="1" colspan="2" class="whs10">
<p><img src="../images/hidden_part_divided_mesh.gif" width="377px" height="225px" border="0" class="img_whs11" alt=""></p>
</td>
