<p><span lang="EN-GB">Each new sub-mesh entity has the original mesh name followed by a number from 1 to N.</span></p>
<p class="Use" id="p1"><span lang="EN-GB" style="font-weight:bold;"><b>Use</b></span><span lang="EN-GB">: This command is very useful when detecting features on CAD models.</span></p>
<p>The inverse command is <a href="combine_selected_entities.htm">Combine Selected Entities</a>.</p>

